Available cities and transit agencies: Alba Iulia (STP), Brasov (RATBv), Bucharest (RATB & Metrorex), Cluj-Napoca (CTP), Constanta (RATC), Craiova (RAT), Iasi (RATP), Oradea (OTL), Ploiesti (TCE), Sibiu (TurSib), Timisoara (RATT)

Whether you are a student, a tourist or a local, Transport Urban is the perfect journey planner kit: map, stops, routes, directions and everything else you might need, all wrapped up in a smooth interface. Plan your routes in seconds, share them with your friends or save them for later viewing, buy tickets & subscriptions*.

Features:
- clean and easy to use interface;
- map with bus / tram / subway stations;
- easy to understand, step-by-step directions;
- estimated distances, times and journey costs;
- visual feedback: view / explore your route on the map;
- search: streets & relevant points of interest;
- gps: set your current location as departure / arrival point;
- advanced planning options;
- Romanian & English languages;
- always up to date.

* tickets and/or subscriptions are currently available only in selected cities.

Note: Internet connection required - no offline mode (yet). To ensure fast and up to date results, route calculations are performed by our web server.

Visit our full-featured web app at: www.transporturban.ro

EasyWay mobile – current public transport routes in your mobile

Service is provided in:
 - Bulgaria (Sofia, Burgas, Pleven, Plovdiv, Varna);
 - Croatia (Zagreb);
 - Kazakhstan (Astana, Almaty);
 - Moldova (Chisinau, Tiraspol, Bender, Balti);
 - Serbia (Belgrade);
 - Ukraine (56 major cities);
 - Uzbekistan (Tashkent).

Realtime data is provided in the selected cities, partial coverage may apply:
 - Ukraine (Kyiv, Kharkiv, Dnipro, Lviv, Mariupol, Kherson, Mykolaiv, Kryvyi Rih, Zhytomyr, Kropyvnytskyi, Sumy, Poltava, Oleksandria, Druzhkivka, Drohobych, Truskavets);
 - Moldova (Chisinau)
 - Bulgaria (Varna)

Features:
 - Offline-mode;
 - Optimal A to B route search;
 - Full list of current public transport routes, display-on-the-map possibility in the provided cities
 - Route scheme, schedule or interval, service time and travel cost;
 - GPS tracking of your movement;
 - Public Transport GPS-data for selected cities;
 - Real-time Stop schedule and Route direction;
 - Bookmarks, Cities and Routes Cache for traffic optimization;
 - Information on wheelchair accessible transport;
 - Multi-language interface.

CTM BusFinder is the Official App of CTM SpA that guides you during your trips in the Area of Cagliari.

Through the App, CTM does not access to any of your  personal data stored in the device.

With CTM BusFinder you can:
- Read the last news retrieved from the CTM site and Twitter account;
- See the route of the bus lines on the map with the list of bus stops and schedules;
- Plan your journey to reach your destinations  and see the details about the relevant bus stops;
- See the bus stops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Consult the real-time data about the next bus transits and the relevant routes with reference to a bus stop of interest, also using a QR code reader; 
- See the list of ticket shops around you or in a selected area of interest;
- Manage a list of preferred bus stops for a quick access;
- Purchase CTM single and season electronic tickets;
- Validate electronic tickets by scanning QR codes in CTM buses.
